Mô tả công việc
1. Complete the design, development, debugging and maintenance of Android client applications independently and on time according to the requirements documents;
2. Formulate development task plans according to the project plan to ensure that relevant work is completed on time and with high quality;
3. Complete the module design documents and related explanatory documents to ensure the traceability of the work process;
4. Comply with departmental programming specifications, complete code review and upload to library, and ensure code quality;
5. Actively identify technical risks in the development process, prepare solutions or report risks in advance;
6. Analyze and locate framework layer defects in the responsible domain.
Yêu cầu ứng viên
1. Bachelor degree or above, 2 years or more of experience in Android application/framework development, solid English listening and speaking skills;
2. Master's graduates are preferred, and experience in studying abroad or working in foreign companies is preferred;
3. Expertise in Java/Kotlin language foundation, experience in smart cockpit project development is preferred;
4. Familiar with Git and other related code management tools, familiar with Android development framework and various features (such as multi-threading mechanism, cross-process communication, network programming, etc.), skilled use of Jetpack, Kotlin and other technologies are preferred;
5. Expertise in Android SDK and MVC, MVP, MVVM framework patterns, good knowledge of object-oriented programming and design patterns, and have good coding habits;
6. Having a certain understanding and practice of Android application performance optimization and stability optimization, or familiar with Android framework and analysis related issues, or having worked as a JNI layer C++/C language developer is preferred;
7. Embrace agile practices, such as experience in SCRUM, pair programming, test-driven development, and unit testing is preferred;
8. Work proactively, have a strong sense of responsibility and rigorous work style, and those with strong independent ability are preferred.
