Mô tả công việc
Develop game concepts, core mechanics, gameplay loops, features, and progression systems.
Design levels, game content, difficulty curves, and balancing to create an engaging player experience.
Create and maintain clear Game Design Documents covering gameplay, systems, levels, balance, and content.
Research market trends, competitors, player behavior, and feedback to identify improvement opportunities.
Evaluate prototypes and existing features, analyze gameplay data, and recommend practical design solutions.
Collaborate with Developers, Artists, and other Designers to ensure design quality and successful implementation.
Yêu cầu ứng viên
Passionate about games, especially mobile games.
Have at least 2 years of experience in Game Design; experience in puzzle games is a plus.
Experience in puzzle games is a strong advantage.
Have a solid understanding of player psychology, user behavior, and player motivation.
Understand key game design principles such as fun factors, core loop, progression, difficulty balancing, and retention.
Have experience in game design, game evaluation, and analyzing game performance.
Good understanding of the mobile game market and player trends.
Experience in optimizing and improving live games currently published on Google Play or the App Store is highly preferred.
Good communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.
English proficiency equivalent to IELTS 6.0 or above is a plus.
